  "historyNote": "#1601, eff 7-1-80; ss by # 2237, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2887, eff 10-22-84; ss by #4098, eff 7-22-86, EXPIRED: 7-22-92 New. #7463, eff 3-21-01, EXPIRED: 3-21-09 New. #13804, eff 11-9-23; ss by #13910, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Agr 700)",
